 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Knopfler sound
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: Sounds like Knopflers "Money for Nothing" sound
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 51
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       12**56
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       *****6
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 0
 SUSTAIN 53
   LEVEL 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-2  	a. DISTORTION
 
       TONE 0
 DISTORTION 31
      LEVEL 100

 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 1.70 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL 7.5 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 1.00 kHz
     L.M. Q 1.0
 L.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
    LO FREQ 60 Hz
   LO LEVEL 2.0 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +5.5 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 28
 RELEASE 0
   LEVEL 52
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-6 LINEOUT FILTER
 
 PRESENCE 25
   TREBLE 60
   MIDDLE 100
     BASS 93
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 71
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF
 
 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

